{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"二十年春王二月，夫人姜氏如莒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"夏，齊大災。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"冬，齊人伐戎。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"二十年春，鄭伯和王室，不克。執燕仲父。夏，鄭伯遂以王歸，王處于櫟。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"秋，王及鄭伯入于鄔。遂入成周，取其寶器而還。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_49_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_49","textTraditional":"冬，王子頹享五大夫，樂及徧舞。鄭伯聞之，見虢叔曰：「寡人聞之，哀樂失時，殃咎必至。今王子頹歌舞不倦，樂禍也。夫司寇行戮，君為之不舉，而況敢樂禍乎！奸王之位，禍孰大焉？臨禍忘憂，憂必及之。盍納王乎？」虢公曰：「寡人之願也。」","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}